\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span><div class=\"recipe-text\">550</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Bancroft%27s_Talon?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Notes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Bancroft%27s_Talon?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Notes\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Bancroft's Talon</a> provides a Stack for every 5% missing health for a maximum of 12 Stacks at 60% missing health\n<ul><li>each stack provides 5 Intelligence and 0.8 Lifesteal</li></ul></li>\n<li>At max Stacks <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Bancroft's Talon</a> grants:\n<ul><li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mn>55</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>115</mn></mstyle></mrow></math> Intelligence</li>\n<li><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" class=\"mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mn>7.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#x25;</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#x25;</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">=</mo><mn>17.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#x25;</mi></mstyle></mrow></math> Lifesteal</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Bancroft%27s_Talon?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Bancroft%27s_Talon?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Bancroft's Talon</a> is most likely a reference to Dalton Bancroft, a character from Global Agenda, another game from HiRez<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\";\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:2px;\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"nowraplinks mw-collapsible mw-autocollapse\" style=\"width:100%;background:transparent;color:inherit;;\" data-expandtext=\"show\" data-collapsetext=\"hide\"><tbody><tr><th style=\";\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"navbox-title\"><span style=\"float:left;width:6em;text-align:left;\"><div class=\"noprint plainlinks navbar\" style=\"background:none; padding:0; font-weight:normal;;;background:none transparent;border:none;font-size:100%;; font-size:small;\"><a class=\"text\" href=\"https://wiki.smite2.com/w/Template:Item_nav\"><span title=\"View this template\" style=\";;background:none transparent;border:none;font-size:100%;\">v</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"text\" href=\"https://wiki.smite2.com/w/